{"seq":2,"slug":"backend-service-structure","title":"后端服务结构与分层","stage":"DONE","category":"backend-engineering","categoryLabel":"后端工程","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/backend-engineering/backend-service-structure","rating":{"composite":3.54,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 后端服务结构与分层 简介\n\n如何把一个后端服务的代码结构好，是它能否长期可维护的关键。本 hub 面向构建中大型后端服务的工程师，从分层的根本目的（对抗关注点纠缠、用单向依赖把变化局部化）讲起，对比水平分层、六边形、整洁架构与轻量 DDD 等风格，落到按特性分包与 Go 工程布局等具体组织方式，最后讨论结构如何随复杂度渐进演化。贯穿全篇的主张是：依赖应指向稳定、复杂度应被证明而非被默认，结构始终服务于「让变化持续可控」。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"layering-fundamentals","title":"Layering Fundamentals","docCount":3,"url":"/h/backend-engineering/backend-service-structure/layering-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-layering","title":"为什么要分层","url":"/h/backend-engineering/backend-service-structure/layering-fundamentals/why-layering","wordCount":1396,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"dependency-direction","title":"依赖方向与依赖倒置","url":"/h/backend-engineering/backend-service-structure/layering-fundamentals/dependency-direction","wordCount":1381,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"layer-responsibilities","title":"各层的职责边界","url":"/h/backend-engineering/backend-service-structure/layering-fundamentals/layer-responsibilities","wordCount":1325,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"本章建立分层的第一性认知：先讲清不分层会烂在哪、分层用单向依赖把变化局部化的核心思想，再论证依赖应指向稳定、依赖倒置如何让业务核心不被技术细节牵连，最后逐层界定接口层、业务层、数据层各自的职责边界与「放错位置」的味道。\n"},{"seq":2,"slug":"architectural-styles","title":"Architectural Styles","docCount":3,"url":"/h/backend-engineering/backend-service-structure/architectural-styles","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"layered-vs-hexagonal","title":"分层架构与六边形架构","url":"/h/backend-engineering/backend-service-structure/architectural-styles/layered-vs-hexagonal","wordCount":1331,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"clean-architecture","title":"整洁架构","url":"/h/backend-engineering/backend-service-structure/architectural-styles/clean-architecture","wordCount":1274,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"ddd-lite-in-practice","title":"轻量 DDD 实践","url":"/h/backend-engineering/backend-service-structure/architectural-styles/ddd-lite-in-practice","wordCount":1412,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"本章对比几种分层的具体风格：水平分层直观但需额外施加依赖倒置，六边形把核心保护做成结构默认，整洁架构用一条依赖规则统一这一家族，轻量 DDD 则提供实体/值对象/聚合等战术构造块为业务层注入领域表达力。贯穿其中的判据是按复杂度选择，而非追逐「更先进」的图形。\n"},{"seq":3,"slug":"project-organization","title":"Project Organization","docCount":3,"url":"/h/backend-engineering/backend-service-structure/project-organization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"package-by-feature-vs-layer","title":"按特性分包还是按层分包","url":"/h/backend-engineering/backend-service-structure/project-organization/package-by-feature-vs-layer","wordCount":1182,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"go-project-layout","title":"Go 项目布局","url":"/h/backend-engineering/backend-service-structure/project-organization/go-project-layout","wordCount":1188,"readingTime":5},{"seq":3,"slug":"module-boundaries","title":"模块边界与依赖管理","url":"/h/backend-engineering/backend-service-structure/project-organization/module-boundaries","wordCount":1376,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"本章把分层原则落到源码目录：对比按层与按特性分包并论证后者更契合高内聚低耦合，给出 Go 的 cmd/internal/pkg 布局与 internal 这一编译器强制的边界利器，最后讨论如何识别好的模块边界、治理模块间依赖，并在模块化单体与微服务之间务实判断。\n"},{"seq":4,"slug":"evolving-structure","title":"Evolving Structure","docCount":3,"url":"/h/backend-engineering/backend-service-structure/evolving-structure","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"when-to-add-layers","title":"何时增加分层","url":"/h/backend-engineering/backend-service-structure/evolving-structure/when-to-add-layers","wordCount":1408,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"avoiding-over-engineering","title":"避免过度工程","url":"/h/backend-engineering/backend-service-structure/evolving-structure/avoiding-over-engineering","wordCount":1433,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"refactoring-toward-boundaries","title":"朝边界重构","url":"/h/backend-engineering/backend-service-structure/evolving-structure/refactoring-toward-boundaries","wordCount":1327,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"本章讨论结构的演化：从最简单形态起步并按真实痛点的信号渐进加层，用「复杂度应被证明而非被默认」抵御过度工程，并依靠测试保护下的安全小步重构把代码持续朝清晰边界校准，让结构成为随系统一起养护的活体而非一次定型的蓝图。\n"}]}